Name: Mohamed Azab
Student ID: 101331588

Purpose:
  Manage telephone company subscribers and chronological messages.
  Print all messages, each subscriber's messages, and rankings by overall
  activity, sending frequency, or receiving frequency. Internal messages
  refer to existing Subscriber objects, and external messages store
  phone numbers. This includes A2's sender and receiver ranking features.

Source files:
  main.cc Control.cc View.cc Time.cc Date.cc Subscriber.cc SubArray.cc
  Msg.cc ExternMsg.cc InternMsg.cc MsgList.cc Telco.cc

Header files:
  Control.h View.h Time.h Date.h Subscriber.h SubArray.h Msg.h
  ExternMsg.h InternMsg.h MsgList.h Telco.h defs.h

Compilation:
  make

Launching:
  ./a3

There are no command-line arguments.
Menu:
  1 - Print all messages
  2 - Print all subscribers and their messages
  3 - Print subscribers by overall activity
  4 - Rank subscribers by messages sent (A2 bonus)
  5 - Rank subscribers by messages received (A2 bonus)
  0 - Exit

Cleanup:
  make clean

